      "Handoff A每个Manifest member只建一条Binding并从`LibraBindingDraft@1`逐项复制`CandidatePrimaryMaterialDelivery@1`的Physical Identity、size、endpoint/location与immutable provenance，五项Identity/size字段不得从materialKey反解、从current Field补读或使用默认值",
